  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a formation space at Hidden Dragon Cave, Eastern Sea rank eight Gu Immortal Qing Yue An finds a flaw and activates it. The phantom mountain strikes the formation’s loophole. Hidden Dragon Cave’s super immortal formation had already reached its limits against Eastern Sea’s Gu Immortals and Di Zang Sheng. The formation collapses. Old Man Bei Feng suffers backlash and spatters blood. Qing Yue An stays behind to heal. He is not a formation path Gu Immortal, so he could not resolve the formation through formation path means and used brute force instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1707
      ],
